# Keep the summarised metrics — results/<stamp>/runs.jsonl and
# runs.rescored.jsonl — so every published number stays auditable in git.
#
# Drop the per-run working directories: scaffolded source, agent transcripts,
# frame dumps and build output. They are large, regenerable, and the transcripts
# can carry incidental machine detail (absolute paths, environment) that has no
# business in a public repository.
*/*/
